      "writtenOn": "2021-06-25T21:00:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If we move it, we add another quirk to carry forward in fs_mgr. If there\u0027s a technical benefit, like simplifying the microdroid use case - let\u0027s do it. If there\u0027s no technical benefit then I\u0027m not sure it\u0027s worth it.",
